                "\n",
                "Analysis of **all-purpose (interactive) clusters** over the trailing window selected below. Each cluster is categorized as **Over-Utilized**, **Under-Utilized**, **Right-Sized**, or **Idle/Unused**, with a concrete recommendation for change. Sources: `system.compute.clusters`, `system.compute.node_timeline`, `system.billing.usage`."
              ]
            }
